pointed his wand. "Wake up!" he cried. Ka-zap!

81
00:06:08.151 --> 00:06:13.079
Bing! The spell bounced off the glass case. Monsters

82
00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.322
covered their heads and dived out of the way. The

83
00:06:16.323 --> 00:06:20.068
spell zapped over their heads and shot into the next room. Cleo

84
00:06:20.069 --> 00:06:23.115
peeled her hand away from her eyes. "Did

85
00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:27.080
the spell work?" she asked in a hushed voice. Ben

86
00:06:27.081 --> 00:06:29.858
turned to look at the display case. Unfortunately

87
00:06:29.859 --> 00:06:33.715
Uncle Tut was still inside. Then

88
00:06:33.716 --> 00:06:36.635
he heard Winnie gasp. "It

89
00:06:36.636 --> 00:06:41.702
